==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 280 seconds<sup>8,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], deploy a [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and keep spamming meatshields followed up by [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]]. When Hippoe and Pigge spawn, let them move towards the Cat Base. Meanwhile, upgrade the Worker Cat once again. When they come close enough, spam meatshields, Axe Cats and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]].

