==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Okayama Prefecture'''.
*Okayama Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Momotarō|Momotarō]], a Japanese folk hero who in the modern era is commonly associated with Okayama, where he even has [https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g298134-d8542987-Reviews-Momotaro_Statue-Okayama_Okayama_Prefecture_Chugoku.html his own statue].

